// @reject: `>>~ (row, col)` with nothing to print shows the terminal's cursor
// @reject: there (D-16). A style or a colour has nothing to apply to, so a
// @reject: third slot is refused rather than ignored: the reader who wrote it
// @reject: meant to print, and forgot `> items`. `>>~ (1, 6)` is the cursor.
>>| {
    >>~ (1, 6, 1)
}
